      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠥᠩᠺᠠᠷᠠᠺᠥᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>öngkeregüü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>өнгөрүү</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ØNGGEREGYY</transcript>
      <definition>adv. [only before an adj.] Extremely, excessive[ly]; too.</definition>
      <page>638</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠥᠩᠺᠠᠷᠠᠺᠥᠥ ᠶᠡᠺᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- jeke</transcript>
          <definition> Too big, too much.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠯᠢᠪᠠᠶᠢ ᠥᠩᠺᠠᠷᠠᠺᠥᠥ ᠶᠡᠺᠡ ᠡᠳᠯᠡᠪᠡᠰᠦ ᠭᠡᠮ ᠪᠣᠯᠤᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>alibaji -- jeke edlebesy gem bolumui</transcript>
          <definition> It is harmful to overindulge in anything.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
